# Generated by forge from python/fastapi/no-on-event (mode: forbid).
id: python/fastapi/no-on-event
language: Python
severity: error
message: "forge:python/fastapi/no-on-event FastAPI() and APIRouter() take no on_startup or on_shutdown handlers: startup and shutdown go in the lifespan context manager (FastAPI(lifespan=lifespan)). The deprecated @app.on_event decorator is python/no-deprecated (ty reads FastAPI's deprecation)."
